  "title": "Zesty Mustardy Indian Kidney Beans Rajma",
  "description": "A flavorful and spicy Indian dish made with kidney beans, mustard, and a blend of spices, perfect for a midnight craving. This halal-friendly recipe is a classic Udupi dish from southern India.",
