  "instructions": [
    "Heat the mustard oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mustard paste, garam masala, cumin powder, and salt, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soaked and drained kidney beans and 2 cups of water to the pan.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Mash some of the kidney beans to thicken the sauce.",
    "Serve the rajma hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
